        <mxCell id="b56HKQ0-fOi4zca5H6zY-67" edge="1" parent="1" source="b56HKQ0-fOi4zca5H6zY-1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="b56HKQ0-fOi4zca5H6zY-2" value="Statement&lt;div&gt;Identification&lt;/div&gt;">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b56HKQ0-fOi4zca5H6zY-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#666666;fillColor=#f5f5f5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontColor=#333333;" value="&quot;Eli is not soft. Eli is not jittery. Eli is not poised. If someone is southern, then he is neither jittery nor soft. If someone is jittery or soft, then he is scared. Eli is scared if and only if Patricia is soft and Broderick is not civil. If someone is soft, then he is southern, and vice versa. It can be concluded that Eli is not jittery once knowing that Olive is not civil and Broderick is poised. If someone is soft and poised, then he is both jittery and not southern, and vice versa. As long as someone is soft, he is poised and not scared. Someone who is not jittery is always both civil and not soft. ...&quot;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="290" x="30" y="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
